<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-06T00:28:21.594Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:28:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces continue to repel Afghan Taliban infiltration attempts along the Kurram border, arresting militants, destroying Taliban posts and killing attackers after cross-border firing. In Rawalakot security forces killed 18 protesters, including four children, during demonstrations over basic rights. A bus-truck collision in eastern Pakistan killed 11 people and injured 33, while a shop roof collapse in Karachi killed one person. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBJR2lLamZ6QU9keDZtTl9vLU9pcElOT0FrM1A1cC1mdl9lX1lLVHBMQmYteXpRMkhnOTVpV092UVg1dURSYWJGSmlxTkhFSldjTjFPOHJGRExaUHdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9UUlJ1VURBSUMyVlhhQzRlT3I3UVFTM3Q0c00zc1EyamwwU3lwbVdfOUtVWVRRd3ZheHRVMHJIT2VoRFR6SlJLaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOT1NwRnNjTzRXMFN3dndmcGdCMTdtSmttZERrUFVJMUR4QmFmVTFZM2RDOHZjbGs1ZUxqRW56ZWt4UjRKWXk1NENkNVdMTVVPVmdzNmxvRGh3OUVkMkNQdS01ektPR0N4RlNhbm9UWW00bVhOb2l4X29UcmRFd2ZNVlpNTE50Z1BpbmRnT0xPZHBual9feWp1dl8zaF9BRHN2d2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQMmx0MFVaS295eWhsVWdFaDNzMTVlcFd6bUZhYU0zai13NFNJcXZpQnRIaF9QOXFBMmpuX0dOOGtWQ2pPUFBOa3Z3Mm80ZXZDT3RSNWFvSVlWRWhUTjhIOTc3QnB1b0xiVEtLcFNsdnFqWnBCbXdJb1JjLUhFMmtaWjFRVzhtOG5NMnpMc0pReFNxOGZtWVgtUWNEdld6NjgxNTdoU25Fdk9ERlBRcV9DbnpnSlVZNm9rNmVhWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation (Pakistan )&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPdU1odzNBQUN4ZzhvYXNhXzNvNWUxS0JscjBzbWFtQWUwZXVSNmNUYXVDRGlXeEdKVm16czFL